REMARK  TDC (Trajectory Dihedral Confidence) in B-factor column
REMARK  Analogous to pLDDT: 0 = low confidence, 100 = high confidence
REMARK
REMARK  TDC > 70  HIGH    strong dihedral restraint was applied
REMARK  TDC 40-70 MEDIUM  moderate restraint was applied
REMARK  TDC < 40  LOW     no restraint applied (flexible/uncertain)
REMARK
REMARK  Visualise in PyMOL:
REMARK    spectrum b, blue_white_red, minimum=0, maximum=100
REMARK
REMARK  Visualise in VMD:
REMARK    mol modcolor 0 0 Beta
REMARK    color scale method BWR
REMARK
